In article <3F37B042.9060104@gwu.edu>, Chris Mattern  <syscjm@gwu.edu> wrote:
> You don't understand what he means by "insert mode".  You have no idea of
> what he is talking about.  You have no understanding of vi whatsoever.
> The opposite of "insert mode" is not "overwrite mode".  The opposite
