   4ef.8001    1    16      8    simple    **     **  async  25%  24_005.tif_128

One thing to note in this case is how small the pyramid is. This
has little to no affect though. Some pyramids are 100MB with an
associated 500MB image and end up with a Perf rating of 13-20%
when created in the same manner. Also note that this can happen
with the system 80% empty and right after a full defrag/balance.

